<title>CANADA: Canada's Prairies to see cool, rain weather.</title>
<headline>Canada's Prairies to see cool, rain weather.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Prairies on Wednesday to see cool and rainy weather, Environment Canada said.</p>
<p>Alberta should see rainy weather and highs of 3 to 18 Celsius.</p>
<p>Saskatchewan should see rainy weather and highs of 5 to 16 Celsius.</p>
<p>Manitoba should see showers in the west and highs of 6 to 15 Celsius.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
